  "question": {
    "text": "The upper half of an inclined plane with inclination <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϕ</mi></math>&nbsp;is perfectly smooth while the lower half is rough. A body starting from rest at the top will again come to rest at the bottom if the coefficient of friction for the lower half is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
