  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "For the smooth upper half, using&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>as</mi></math>, we get<br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>sin&#981;</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></math><br /><br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mo>(</mo><mi>sin&#981;</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></msqrt></math><br /><br />For the lower half, using <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>as</mi></math>, we get<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>sin</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#981;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></msub><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>cos&#981;</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>sin&#981;</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></math><br /><br />or&nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin&#981;</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></msub><mi>cos&#981;</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>sin&#981;</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></msub><mi>cos&#981;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sin&#981;</mi></math><br /><br />or&nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>tan&#981;</mi></math>",
